<title>USA: First Union wins $78 mln Middletown, N.J., bonds.</title>
<headline>First Union wins $78 mln Middletown, N.J., bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union Capital Markets said it won $78 million of Board of Education of the Township of Middletown, N.J., school bonds with a net interest cost (NIC) of 5.79 percent.</p>
</text>
